 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->515379898,ExpressionUUID->"a0a3bcad-8b2c-4e61-bda4-81ccb7348af1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Each 3D agent has a 3D position and unit heading vector, senses along its \
heading plus a randomly rotated ring of four sensors tilted by ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<SensorAngle\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c4bc1f38-cb0e-4ec3-82d9-a1f4a68356b7"],
 ", turns by ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RotationAngle\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "812cf116-e1a5-4f27-9275-eafb0758572a"],
 " toward the strongest reading, moves by ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<StepSize\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "8c66fac6-28b5-4577-a4a5-d9f10e51db97"],
 ", and deposits ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Deposit\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "a03b3989-3c7a-4207-8244-5890389ae116"],
 " into the voxel grid."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->604760901,ExpressionUUID->"630cefc7-2767-4dcc-b8f0-b3b4993d957e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The trail map diffuses over the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"3", "\[Times]", "3", "\[Times]", "3"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3e7e94fd-c05d-441e-8716-87f689b2810a"],
 " neighborhood of each voxel and decays by ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Decay\>\""], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1b0f5d3c-14ca-481e-81ea-5ec1251c3cfc"],
 " at every step."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1476799103,ExpressionUUID->"9ad1a992-0075-490a-9833-39127ecbaca5"],

